  "title": "HTTP: Make the upgrade dissector table case insensitive",
  "description": "https://datatracker.ietf.org/doc/html/rfc9110#section-16.7\n\n\"A protocol-name token is case-insensitive and registered with the\npreferred case to be generated by senders.\"\n\nIt's easy for someone to register in a different dissector with the\npreferred case instead of lower case, as has already been done in a\nfew cases. Since there aren't that many registered tokens (or other\nunregistered tokens added to our table), just make the table\ncase-insensitive to reduce the chance of mistakes.\n\nAI-Assisted: no",
